Unforced Error — Licensing & Copyright
======================================

This project combines two separately-licensed bodies of work: third-party DATA,
and original CODE & DESIGN. The terms for each are set out below and are meant to
be read together.

Unforced Error (unforcederror.app) is a free, non-commercial project: it carries
no advertising and no monetization of any kind, in compliance with the
NonCommercial term of the data license in section 1.


--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. DATA  —  Creative Commons BY-NC-SA 4.0
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

All tennis data in this project comes from Jeff Sackmann's `tennis_atp` dataset:

    https://github.com/JeffSackmann/tennis_atp

That dataset is licensed by its author under the Creative Commons
Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International License (CC BY-NC-SA 4.0):

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/4.0/

Under that license, this project honours all three terms:

  - Attribution    Jeff Sackmann is credited as the source of the data — here,
                   in the site footer, and on the About page.
  - NonCommercial  The data is used for no commercial purpose: no ads, no paid
                   features, no monetization.
  - ShareAlike     The processed data and any work derived from it — the built
                   Parquet artifacts, the computed aggregates, and the figures,
                   leaderboards, and rankings drawn from them — are distributed
                   under the same CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 license, with attribution to
                   Jeff Sackmann.

This project is not affiliated with or endorsed by Jeff Sackmann, the ATP, or any
tennis governing body. Please support his work: https://www.tennisabstract.com/


